  "body": "⭕ When a chaos token is sealed on a card you control (limit once per round):\n<bul> If the sealed token has a negative modifier, deal 1 damage to an enemy at your location.\n<bul> If the sealed token has a positive or neutral modifier, discover 1 clue at your location.\n⭐ effect: +1. You may release a chaos token sealed on a card you control. Then, you may choose and seal a different non-🐙 chaos token on that card.",
  "flavor": "",
  "illustrator": "Aleksander Karcz",
  "card_number": "10",
  "encounter_group_number": "",
  "picture_base64": "data:image/jpeg;base64,",
  "image_mode": 1,
  "back": {
    "name": "🏅Agnes Baker",
    "subtitle": "The Waitress",
    "class": "潜修者",
    "card_back": {
      "other": "【Deckbuilding Options】: Mystic cards (🧘) level 0-5, cards with \"seal\" level 0-5, Neutral cards level 0-5.\n【Deckbuilding Requirements】 (do not count toward deck size): Heirloom of Hyperborea, Dark Memory, 1 random basic weakness.",
      "story": "Agnes Baker may be just an unassuming waitress in this life, but in a previous life, in a time and age undreamed of in the modern world, she had been a powerful witch. It began when she found a strange artifact - a key of some kind - in a dusty collection of family belongings in her attic. When she touched it, the memories came flooding back, along with one word: \"Hyperborea.\" The more she delved into the visions and memories of her former life, the stronger her powers grew... and the more frightened she became.",
      "size": 25
    },
